() Tj T*
(Opinion) Tj T*
(We have audited the financial statements of Test Municipal Corporation, which comprise the) Tj T*
(Balance Sheet as at 31st March 2025, the Income and Expenditure Account, the Receipts) Tj T*
(and Payments Account and the Cash Flow Statement for the year then ended, and) Tj T*
(notes to the financial statements, including a summary of significant) Tj T*
(accounting policies.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In our opinion, the accompanying financial statements give a true and fair view) Tj T*
(of the financial position of the ULB as at 31st March 2025, and of its financial) Tj T*
(performance and its cash flows for the year then ended, in accordance with the) Tj T*
(National Municipal Accounts Manual and the State Municipal Accounts Manual.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Basis for Opinion) Tj T*
(We conducted our audit in accordance with the Standards on Auditing issued by) Tj T*
(the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India. Our responsibilities under) Tj T*
(those standards are described in the Auditor's Responsibilities section. We) Tj T*
(believe the audit evidence we obtained is sufficient and appropriate to provide) Tj T*
(a basis for our opinion.) Tj T*
